# Crate Architecture
- core → (no internal deps)
- db → core
- memory → core, db
- providers → core
- mcp → core
- agent → core, db, memory, providers, mcp
- gateway → core, agent, security
- scheduler → core, db, langbridge
- security → core
- langbridge → core
- observability → core
- channels → core
- skills → core, security
- cli → all crates
